WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
3D Multidetector Computed Tomography Coronary Angiography (CTCA).

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Volume-rendered rotational 3D CT reconstruction demonstrating the epicardial coronary arterial tree.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Notice the origin of the left anterior descending (LAD) and circumflex arteries from the aortic sinus.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Rotational views evaluate anomalous arterial courses between the aorta and pulmonary artery, ruling out malignant interarterial compression.
